@startuml arsitektur_global_dan_aliran_data
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #333333
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam NoteBorderColor #CCCCCC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0

title Diagram Arsitektur Global & Alur REST API Terpadu

box "Frontend Pengunjung" #F8F9FA
    actor "Pengunjung\n(Public Visitor)" as User
    participant "portofolio-web\n(Next.js App)" as Web
    participant "API Route\n/api/contact" as ContactAPI
end box

box "Backend & Database Cloud" #EEF2FF
    participant "Supabase\nPostgREST & Storage" as SupabaseAPI
    database "PostgreSQL\nDatabase" as DB
    participant "Supabase\nRealtime (WebSocket)" as Realtime
end box

box "Frontend CMS Admin" #F0FDF4
    actor "Firman\n(Admin)" as Admin
    participant "portofolio-admin\n(Next.js App)" as AdminApp
    participant "Admin API Route\n/api/auth/*" as AuthAPI
end box

box "External Provider" #FEF3C7
    participant "GitHub API v3\n(api.github.com)" as GitHubAPI
end box

== 1. Pengunjung Mengakses Website ==
User -> Web: Buka website (/)
activate Web
Web -> SupabaseAPI: GET /rest/v1/profile, projects, skills, experiences
activate SupabaseAPI
SupabaseAPI -> DB: Query data aktif
DB --> SupabaseAPI: Return baris data JSON
SupabaseAPI --> Web: Response JSON (Status 200 OK)
deactivate SupabaseAPI
Web -> Realtime: Subscribe channel realtime (WebSocket)
Web --> User: Render UI interaktif, bio, tech stack, dan studi kasus
deactivate Web

== 2. Pengunjung Mengirim Pesan Kontak (REST API Internal) ==
User -> Web: Isi form kontak & klik "Kirim Pesan"
activate Web
Web -> ContactAPI: POST /api/contact\n{name, email, subject, message, botField}
activate ContactAPI
note over ContactAPI: - Validasi format email & sanitasi\n- Rate Limit: Maks 4 pesan per 10 menit\n- Honeypot check: botField harus kosong
ContactAPI -> SupabaseAPI: INSERT into "messages"
SupabaseAPI -> DB: Simpan pesan masuk
DB --> SupabaseAPI: Status 201 Created
ContactAPI --> Web: Response JSON {success: true}\n(Status 200 OK)
deactivate ContactAPI
Web --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi sukses & confetti animasi
Realtime -->> AdminApp: Broadcast event pesan baru
deactivate Web

== 3. Autentikasi Pengelola CMS (Admin Session) ==
Admin -> AdminApp: Buka dashboard admin & masukkan password
activate AdminApp
AdminApp -> AuthAPI: POST /api/auth/login {password}
activate AuthAPI
note over AuthAPI: Verifikasi password via environment hash
AuthAPI --> AdminApp: Set HTTP-Only Cookie (Session Token)\nStatus 200 OK
deactivate AuthAPI
AdminApp --> Admin: Masuk ke Dashboard Admin
deactivate AdminApp

== 4. Manajemen CRUD Konten & Detail Studi Kasus ==
Admin -> AdminApp: Tambah / Edit Proyek & Detail Studi Kasus
activate AdminApp
AdminApp -> SupabaseAPI: PUT/POST /rest/v1/projects\n{title, longDescription, highlights, metrics, ...}
activate SupabaseAPI
SupabaseAPI -> DB: UPDATE / INSERT data proyek
DB --> SupabaseAPI: Status 200 OK / 201 Created
SupabaseAPI --> AdminApp: Response data proyek ter-update
AdminApp --> Admin: Notifikasi toast "Proyek berhasil diperbarui!"
deactivate SupabaseAPI

DB -> Realtime: Event TRIGGER (UPDATE projects)
Realtime -->> Web: WebSocket push payload (Data berubah)
Web --> User: Tampilan website otomatis ter-update (Tanpa reload!)
deactivate AdminApp

== 5. Sinkronisasi Data dari GitHub API ==
Admin -> AdminApp: Klik tombol "Sinkronkan dengan GitHub"
activate AdminApp
AdminApp -> GitHubAPI: GET https://api.github.com/users/moch-firmansyahh
AdminApp -> GitHubAPI: GET https://api.github.com/users/moch-firmansyahh/repos
activate GitHubAPI
GitHubAPI --> AdminApp: JSON repositori publik, stars, fork, bahasa
deactivate GitHubAPI
AdminApp -> AdminApp: Komparasi repositori baru vs database
AdminApp --> Admin: Muncul dialog konfirmasi impor data GitHub
Admin -> AdminApp: Konfirmasi setuju impor
AdminApp -> SupabaseAPI: INSERT into "projects" / "skills"
SupabaseAPI -> DB: Simpan hasil impor GitHub
AdminApp --> Admin: Notifikasi "Sinkronisasi GitHub Selesai"
deactivate AdminApp

@enduml
